  "Name": "Moodle Admin Shell Upload",
  "Description": "This module will generate a plugin which can receive a malicious payload request and upload it to a server running Moodle provided valid admin credentials are used. Then the payload is sent for execution, and the plugin uninstalled. You must have an admin account to exploit this vulnerability. Successfully tested against 3.6.3, 3.8.0, 3.9.0, 3.10.0, 3.11.2",
